From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: saiththerobo <the.tom.sharp@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 07:54:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: exynos: google: gs101-pixel-common: label the
 MAX77759

Give pmic@66 a label, so a board can add properties to it (raven's
monitored-battery for the charger cell) without repeating the bus path.

No functional change.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: saiththerobo <the.tom.sharp@gmail.com>
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-pixel-common.dtsi | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-pixel-common.dtsi b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-pixel-common.dtsi
index 4717ec221..c5529e449 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-pixel-common.dtsi
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/google/gs101-pixel-common.dtsi
@@ -750,7 +750,7 @@ fuel-gauge@36 {
 		shunt-resistor-micro-ohms = <5000>;
 	};
 
-	pmic@66 {
+	pmic: pmic@66 {
 		compatible = "maxim,max77759";
 		reg = <0x66>;
 
